      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gates_County%2C_North_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Gates County lies within the Inner Banks, an area centered on the Albemarle Sound that shapes its waterways.",
